<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling holds firm against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling holds firm against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was posted at a marginally firmer commercial rate of 590.4756 against the dollar on Tuesday compared to 590.5746 on Monday.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling was traded at a mean rate of 921.5278 versus 921.5636 on Monday, commercial dealers said.</p>
</text>
